flowchart LR
    A[Observe raw telemetry] --> B[Try explicit thresholds]
    B --> C[Segment cycles and normalize]
    C --> D[Learn device and site behavior]
    D --> E[Score confidence and trend]
    E --> F[Learn from service outcomes]
    F --> D
    classDef telemetry fill:#0e2f2e,stroke:#14B8A6,color:#d1fae5,stroke-width:2px
    classDef ai fill:#191b4a,stroke:#6366F1,color:#e0e7ff,stroke-width:2px
    classDef healthy fill:#10351f,stroke:#22C55E,color:#dcfce7,stroke-width:2px
    class A telemetry
    class B,C infra
    class D,E ai
    class F healthy
